findings = ""
i = 0
for d in context:
    i = i + 1
    prompt = "You are given a document. Extract any information relevant to identifying a specific video game and its protagonist under these constraints. For everything you find, quote exact lines and provide your reasoning.\n\nConstraints to check (match as many as possible):\n- The video game features a black hole somewhere in its story or setting.\n- The game was first released between 2016 and 2019 exclusive (i.e., 2017 or 2018) for a particular platform in a particular year.\n- Two years later, another version for new platforms was released.\n- A more enhanced version was released three years after the initial release.\n- The game was developed and published by the same company.\n- That company was incorporated in October in either 2011 or 2012 (i.e., October 2011 or October 2012).\n- The protagonist's first name starts with the letter 'Z'. Provide the protagonist's full name (first and last) if available.\n- A person who worked as a freelancer concept artist on the initial version of this game also worked on a video game that was released in 2009. Identify them and the 2009 game.\n- Another person who worked on the later versions of this game was the senior programmer for another game released in February of a year between 2020 and 2023 (inclusive). Identify them, the role, the other game, and its release month/year.\n\nFor any candidates this document suggests, provide:\n- Candidate game title\n- Protagonist full name (first and last), making sure the first name starts with 'Z'\n- Developer/publisher company name and its incorporation month/year\n- Release timeline (initial platform+year; new platforms + year two years later; enhanced version + year three years later)\n- Staff details matching the two bullet constraints above\n- Quotes and citations from the document that support each claim\n- A confidence score 0-100 and short justification\n\nDocument:\nBEGIN_DOCUMENT\n" + d + "\nEND_DOCUMENT"
    result = llm_query(prompt)
    findings = findings + "\n\n=== Document " + str(i) + " Analysis ===\n" + result

final_prompt = "You are to determine the exact protagonist (first and last name) of the video game described, using the collated findings below. Apply strict logical consistency; the correct answer must satisfy ALL constraints simultaneously. If multiple candidates appear, choose the one that fully matches every constraint. If none fully match, choose the best-supported that matches the majority and explain any missing pieces, but still output only the name at the end.\n\nConstraints recap:\n- Game features a black hole in its story\n- Initial release year is 2017 or 2018, specifically for a particular platform\n- Another version released two years later for new platforms\n- An enhanced version released three years after the initial\n- Developed and published by the same company that was incorporated in October 2011 or October 2012\n- The protagonist’s first name starts with 'Z'\n- A freelancer concept artist on the initial version also worked on a video game released in 2009\n- A person who worked on later versions was senior programmer for another game released in February 2020–2023\n\nFindings:\n" + findings + "\n\nTask: Identify the single correct game and, most importantly, the protagonist’s full name. Output ONLY the protagonist’s first and last name, nothing else."
answer = llm_query(final_prompt)
return_result(answer)